<title>NORWAY: Norway's Nov foreign trade surplus NOK 10.4 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway's Nov foreign trade surplus NOK 10.4 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statstics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	NOV 1996    OCT 1996    NOV 1995</p>
<p> Imports			    18.92	 21.30	 18.77</p>
<p> Exports			    29.34	 28.45	 21.59</p>
<p> Balance			    10.42	  7.15	  2.83</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		-5.30	 -6.76	 -6.98</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
